msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Nintendo - NES / Famicom (QuickNES)"
msgstr "Nintendo - NES / Famicom (QuickNES)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid ""
"A port of the QuickNES core library, originally by Shay Green, heavily "
"modified. QuickNES is a newer emulator that seems to have good compatibility."
msgstr "En portning av QuickNES kärnbibliotek, ursprungligen av Shay Green, kraftigt modifierad. QuickNES är en nyare emulator som verkar ha god kompatibilitet."

