msgstr "96 kHz"

msgctxt "#30040"
msgid ""
"Configure audio emulation. 'Non-Linear' simulates the non-linear channel "
"mixing of the NES APU. 'Linear' uses a less accurate approximation, which "
"reduces quality but increases performance on low-end hardware. 'Stereo "
"Panning' adds depth to the NES mono output through the use of panning "
"techniques and reverb effects."
msgstr "Konfigurera ljudemulering. ”Non-Linear” simulerar den olinjära kanalmixningen i NES APU. ”Linear” använder en mindre exakt approximation som minskar kvaliteten men ökar prestandan på svagare maskinvara. ”Stereo Panning” ger djup åt NES monoutmatning med panoreringstekniker och efterklangseffekter."

msgctxt "#30041"
msgid "Non-Linear"
msgstr "Olinjär"

msgctxt "#30042"
msgid "Linear"
msgstr "Linjär"

msgctxt "#30043"
msgid "Stereo Panning"
msgstr "Stereopanorering"

msgctxt "#30044"
msgid ""
"Adjust the balance between audio frequency components with a custom "
"equalizer preset."
msgstr "Justera balansen mellan ljudfrekvenskomponenter med en anpassad equalizerförinställning."

